      "total_time": "PT15M",
      "ingredients": [
        "1 cup cooked chickpeas",
        "1 cup cooked red lentils",
        "1 celery rib",
        "1 medium carrot",
        "½ lemon",
        "¼ red bell pepper",
        "½ small red onion",
        "3 Tbsp fresh dill",
        "3 Tbsp vegan mayonnaise",
        "3 Tbsp chopped pickles",
        "2 Tbsp roasted sunflower seeds",
        "1 tsp capers",
        "½ tsp Dijon mustard",
        "¼ tsp salt",
        "1 pinch ground black pepper"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Add the chickpeas to a large bowl and mash with a fork. Add the remaining ingredients to the bowl and mix, mashing slightly.",
        "Chill before serving, if possible, to allow the flavours to infuse. Enjoy!"
